            {
                "entry_id": "31854016-60e0-3a09-92c0-c7405edbfb35",
                "word": "colt",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4d2bc5af-aca4-44fb-aa99-d6cd602c6b6e",
                        "entry_id": "31854016-60e0-3a09-92c0-c7405edbfb35",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "colts"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d39c677-b5b9-3469-8ad7-21d6556ffff3",
                        "entry_id": "31854016-60e0-3a09-92c0-c7405edbfb35",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arme à feu, et en particulier revolver, fabriquée par la société Colt."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Armement"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38868eaf-3ced-4b06-afb0-fdeade47538b",
                                "sense_id": "3d39c677-b5b9-3469-8ad7-21d6556ffff3",
                                "text": "Éaque, Minos et Rhadamante, étoilés de drap rouge et armés de revolvers Colt, fournis naguère aux armées russes par le War Office anglais. Les tchékistes scrutaient mes papiers. Des sourcils froncés sur les segments huileux de trois nez en bec d’aigle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0557f488-789c-4ca2-825e-77b4b1ee4af0",
                                "sense_id": "3d39c677-b5b9-3469-8ad7-21d6556ffff3",
                                "text": "Comme instruments de mes fonctions, Soleil me remet une vieille Underwood et un colt, le gros, celui qui fait du dégât."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b86080eb-280b-428c-bbbe-4c06a4fd45c3",
                                "sense_id": "3d39c677-b5b9-3469-8ad7-21d6556ffff3",
                                "text": "Le jour tant attendu arriva : des camions passèrent le pont-levis et s’offrit à nos yeux l’inoubliable et bouleversant spectacle de containers chargés d’armes parachutées d’Angleterre. Ils furent ouverts avec un respect infini : les mitraillettes Sten, les impressionnants fusils-mitrailleurs Bren à chargeur courbe, les grenades défensives avec leur goupille et leur cuiller qui exploseraient, une fois armées, en gerbes d’éclats meurtriers, les colts 11,43, les charges de plastic Gamon, en forme de grosses poires noires, destinées à faire sauter les ponts ou les blindés, furent alignés sur des bâches."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76d531c5-93c8-43c6-8b63-7743eeb911cf",
                                "sense_id": "3d39c677-b5b9-3469-8ad7-21d6556ffff3",
                                "text": "« Tu penses que ce colt a tué quelqu’un ? avait demandé mon frère en le braquant sur moi. C’était peut-être celui de Shane, ou de Clyde. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1abfecb4-a81b-4f0a-ad60-cb14cb73c5f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "31854016-60e0-3a09-92c0-c7405edbfb35",
                        "source_sense_id": "3d39c677-b5b9-3469-8ad7-21d6556ffff3",
                        "target_lang_word": "colt",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "colt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fd7e308-684d-3cb5-9e04-4e86433a1e1b",
                                        "entry_id": "82da77d0-66f2-3dad-9881-1ce312203248",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young male horse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bd91eac-7a14-4bbc-9ea1-d66189f376e7",
                                                "sense_id": "3fd7e308-684d-3cb5-9e04-4e86433a1e1b",
                                                "text": "The petty vices of boys are like the innocent kicks of colts, as yet imperfectly broken."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00354735-150c-3c77-b8cb-62d9a56c2ff2",
                                        "entry_id": "82da77d0-66f2-3dad-9881-1ce312203248",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young crane (bird)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f72ca593-bfee-3a4d-b211-c2a996ff150e",
                                        "entry_id": "82da77d0-66f2-3dad-9881-1ce312203248",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A youthful or inexperienced person; a novice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92b68857-6895-4dcf-bfa1-dcc0713f7075",
                                                "sense_id": "f72ca593-bfee-3a4d-b211-c2a996ff150e",
                                                "text": "Ay, that's a colt indeed, for he doth nothing but / talk of his horse, and he makes it a great appropriation to / his own good parts that he can shoe him himself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "988a4587-db09-3b43-9405-56b4308530e9",
                                        "entry_id": "82da77d0-66f2-3dad-9881-1ce312203248",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A youthful or inexperienced person; a novice.",
                                            "A professional cricketer during his first season."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b7e551-1790-4973-8e26-2c4ccdf45fd0",
                                                "sense_id": "988a4587-db09-3b43-9405-56b4308530e9",
                                                "text": "The bowling is more promising in the colts than in the eleven."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2b4db03-61bf-3a42-9f1e-fab3a1b75f41",
                                        "entry_id": "82da77d0-66f2-3dad-9881-1ce312203248",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A youthful or inexperienced person; a novice.",
                                            "A person who sits as a juryman for the first time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4c0076c-c821-3f75-b3de-820ba0d51b8e",
                                        "entry_id": "82da77d0-66f2-3dad-9881-1ce312203248",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short piece of rope once used by petty officers as an instrument of punishment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e38edcea-6ce0-3f73-9551-689b0b44c392",
